---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/layout/Container.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="What Bhavya AI Lab is — and is not. A digital laboratory for learning, building, experimenting, and applying AI from Himachal Pradesh."
>
  <Container class="py-14">
    <p class="text-meta uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-h1 mb-6 max-w-2xl">A digital AI laboratory from Himachal Pradesh</h1>
    <div class="prose-lab max-w-content">
      <p>
        Bhavya AI Lab is a place to learn AI, build with AI, experiment honestly, and apply AI to real constraints —
        starting from Himachal Pradesh and India, not only from major metros.
      </p>
      <p>
        The first product is this digital presence. A physical lab may exist in the future. We do not claim facilities,
        partnerships, students, or results we do not have.
      </p>
      <h2>What we publish</h2>
      <p>
        Projects, experiments, and writing appear only when they are real. Empty portfolio sections are intentional
        until evidence exists.
      </p>
      <h2>What we are not</h2>
      <p>
        Not a generic AI marketing site. Not a coaching brochure. Not an inflated claim of institutional scale.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
